       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTRINSIC-FUNCTIONS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 STUDENT-NAME PIC X(20) VALUE "  PRASANNA SAI   ".
       01 NUMBER-VALUE PIC 999 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "NAME: " FUNCTION TRIM(STUDENT-NAME).
           DISPLAY "UPPERCASE: "
                   FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(STUDENT-NAME).
           DISPLAY "NAME LENGTH: "
                   FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(STUDENT-NAME)).
           COMPUTE NUMBER-VALUE = FUNCTION MAX(14, 88, 37).
           DISPLAY "HIGHEST NUMBER: " NUMBER-VALUE.
           COMPUTE NUMBER-VALUE = FUNCTION MOD(47, 5).
           DISPLAY "REMAINDER: " NUMBER-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
